<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-22T22:33:00.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has launched a military operation in Haiti to rescue four kidnapped aviation technicians and four Salvadoran soldiers held by Haitian gangs. President Bukele has warned the gangs that further attacks on Salvadoran forces will meet a harsh response. A gang ambush in Haiti left four international troops missing. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/el-salvador-launches-military-operation-in-haiti-to-free-four-kidnapped-aviation-technicia&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQQ202dHdUU3ViV0c5Um5fdEZrcHVuUjlfOTZZdk1oeHluT3JpbHNZWVJzcW43WDF6N01wSGRNOGlDSDc2YmU4WEJkb3J3STloOW9VdmVtRFFnSUlHRHp1YzA0cTlObXpZLXFQY2NrWkktejV1Qm9femlEZUpfVFVfMnZBODBPQXREYjg2WUVwSW02eWltM2hhdW1JTHRMVEtYVTZpVjFnZ1loNFNHdEtvcEw0dERqNHdyV3FTdQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNX3hCdktfNkFINXNrWmszamM4blcyMVFuYzhPeVJxTXlVc1BHcGRSTHFSS2dzaWx4OWVCU2d5dHlWc1JVV1pPdEdyOWR2YjdOa0pmR3lJWnpoY3RKYlk4VUZ5VEM2cTJSQ0ExMW5ZdlJ0Y0d2bnNuZFVSY01QdnpSTXpXUC01bXVSZ3FMbjlILWNyV3BBemF3NlVWcHl6UHdJb19tNThvSzA2OTgtbjRsLVJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9md1E4bHpDeEhnRDVKcTFaak1zcEtqeE5JaGthSmU2YVFicGZaZTBuVzNYXzZweXdlTkttTnFnT01yeWRnZFE3ZDdlQ2l0LTV6SUtDMmdZZ0FnSVFtWHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPaFlEUDZDeTkwaUxqVFFsUHZvQkJDd3U3R2NqZDY0bmE1ZDg1dE9EVUgzV3g5ZHlkcWs2UXRETmxERkd5dEZxM0ZoWk5JUWJJNGZmNUlNcUNTbllpdW1jS1RFVDdYVk4xajNuTUtZaWFLNUZ